menu "TP-03 concurrent load"

config TP03_STRESS_LEVEL
    int "CPU stress level (0-100%)"
    range 0 100
    default 50
    help
        Controls the CPU duty cycle on both cores. 0 disables the burn;
        100 targets about 95% busy time while preserving a small idle slice
        for the task watchdog. Increase this value between runs to find the
        touch-to-frame latency knee.

endmenu
